      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is thread safe. Also, having a `static` sk_sp has led to subtle use-after-free bugs https://issues.chromium.org/issues/421629753\n\nLet\u0027s do \n```\nstatic SkPathData* gEmpty \u003d MakeNoCheck({}, {}, {}, {}, {}).release();\nreturn sk_ref_sp(gEmpty);\n```\ninstead",
