      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-03T13:13:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Chrome used to complain about static initializers, so I presume I shouldn\u0027t allocate the object right away. Is that still the case?\n\nI\u0027ve changed the pattern to follow what we do in SkData (and other places).",
      "parentUuid": "964dbf3d_82a89226",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 275,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 279,
        "endChar": 0
      },
