      "writtenOn": "2025-10-03T13:21:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/lkgr/docs/static_initializers.md is fine with static intializing in a function that then returns it.\n\nYou don\u0027t need the SkOnce. We\u0027ve been doing patterns like the one I suggested in src/core/SkCPURecorder.cpp in more modern code. Please use that approach.",
